\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live What Others Remember</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evoke playable memories drawn from others, imagined into reality. Each memory brings you closer to the person you used to be, and who you could become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/9dedf3591e554d459e50095df3fccfa0.poster.avif?t=1778957130\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/9dedf3591e554d459e50095df3fccfa0.webm?t=1778957130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remember or Become</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intrusion's hold on you only grows stronger. You must decide whether to reconcile with your origins or embrace an unknown self.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay</strong> in Tempo, or <strong>Leave</strong> for the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/d8fe0592fe425e09c566fd272310d759.webp?t=1778957130\" width=610 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/f4b46bd8019a630d871617c481615374.poster.avif?t=1778957130\" width=610 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336670/extras/f4b46bd8019a630d871617c481615374.webm?t=1778957130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span 